{
  "displayName": "ADK GenAI Metrics & Token Analytics (Enterprise GCP)",
  "mosaicLayout": {
    "columns": 12,
    "tiles": [
      {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 2,
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 0,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Google ADK Enterprise Observability — Managed Service for Prometheus GenAI Histograms",
          "text": {
            "content": "Visualizes all **7 native ADK OpenTelemetry GenAI Histogram Metrics** (`prometheus.googleapis.com/gen_ai.*/histogram`) ingested via Google Cloud Telemetry API (`telemetry.googleapis.com/v1/metrics`) when `GOOGLE_CLOUD_AGENT_ENGINE_ENABLE_TELEMETRY=true`, `OTEL_SEMCONV_STABILITY_OPT_IN=gen_ai_latest_experimental`, and `OTEL_INSTRUMENTATION_GENAI_CAPTURE_MESSAGE_CONTENT=EVENT_ONLY`.\n\n* **Metrics Management**: [Open Metrics Management](https://console.cloud.google.com/monitoring/metrics-management?project=adk-enterprise-observability) | **Trace Waterfall**: [Open Cloud Trace Explorer](https://console.cloud.google.com/traces/explorer?project=adk-enterprise-observability)",
            "format": "MARKDOWN"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 4,
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 2,
        "widget": {
          "title": "1. GenAI Token Usage by Type (gen_ai.client.token.usage/histogram)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "plotType": "STACKED_BAR",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"prometheus.googleapis.com/gen_ai.client.token.usage/histogram\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MEAN",
                      "groupByFields": [
                        "metric.label.\"gen_ai.token.type\"",
                        "metric.label.\"gen_ai.request.model\""
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "tokens / call",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 4,
        "xPos": 6,
        "yPos": 2,
        "widget": {
          "title": "2. GenAI LLM Operation Duration (gen_ai.client.operation.duration/histogram)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "plotType": "STACKED_BAR",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "legendTemplate": "Mean (${metric.labels.gen_ai.request.model})",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"prometheus.googleapis.com/gen_ai.client.operation.duration/histogram\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MEAN",
                      "groupByFields": [
                        "metric.label.\"gen_ai.request.model\""
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "legendTemplate": "p95 (${metric.labels.gen_ai.request.model})",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"prometheus.googleapis.com/gen_ai.client.operation.duration/histogram\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_PERCENTILE_95",
                      "groupByFields": [
                        "metric.label.\"gen_ai.request.model\""
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "seconds",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 4,
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 6,
